    {
      "title": "Usage Instructions",
      "content": [
        "These files contain content that's published on the internet via the cFish.io shortlink service. To update a shortlink's content:",
        "1. Modify the corresponding markdown file",
        "2. Commit and push changes to the repository",
        "3. Deploy changes to the live site"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "JSON Versions",
      "content": [
        "AI-optimized JSON versions of each shortlink are available in the `/shortlinks/json/` directory for AI ingestion and processing. These files are automatically maintained by the MD-to-JSON synchronization system."
      ]
    },
